Package: educontrol-client
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: flatpak
Maintainer: EduControl Packager <packager@example.com>
Description: EduControl client helper
  A small package that installs a session wrapper, a system-wide autostart .desktop
  and a user systemd unit to help start the EduControl Flatpak client in graphical sessions.
